tw-prose-bold);\">&bull; Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227); box-sizing: border-box; list-style-type: disc; margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.625em; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-top: 0.5em; padding-left: 0.375em;\">Join our referral program today to start earning a 10% commission on sales.</li>\r\n<li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-top: 0.5em; padding-left: 0.375em;\">We provide you with marketing materials and dedicated support to help maximize your referrals.</li>\r\n<li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-top: 0.5em; padding-left: 0.375em;\">Track your referrals and earnings easily through our user-friendly dashboard.</li>\r\n<li style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-top: 0.5em; padding-left: 0.375em;\">For any questions or assistance, our support team is available 24/7 via email or chat.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>APPLY NOW!</p>",
